        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ebac544dffd2e59c0da52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5b5a31678ef6a27bc562a56797e1396c6b4717ac8bdbb4ed006b3986707e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f1e0d57ace98bd53c99f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，\r\n名鉴等级提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b9a9660d4b35fb7d73390506aba4ea9636080e69a470c3b3a7f39438ae06e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42af3c604a69859dd21a5945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服穿着很舒服呢。\r\n哪怕弄撒了墨水变脏了，\r\n也可以用力地刷洗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08cec6c4191bf920abd4576c756ae2250475c80ded782d40737359d5614bf1c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dab6b1f9f51a21c38245ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子上的丝带是妹妹推荐给我的。\r\n她说，身为主人公，\r\n不显眼一点可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8e2cb4d1b2e27ef42ea9606e406f9ab5a974b83dd04bbc4e54b324e4945d57",
